<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES LOSE AUSTRALIAN TOUR OPENER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES LOSE AUSTRALIAN TOUR OPENER.</headline>
<dateline>LILAC HILL, Australia 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Cricket Board Chairman's XI beat West Indies by three wickets in their limited overs opening tour match on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 256-9 (50 overs), Chairman's XI 258-7 (42).</p>
